    { "type": "text", "version": 1, "id": "legend", "x": 80, "y": 460, "width": 800, "height": 80, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#475569", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 28, "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "text": "Solid arrows = event-bus communication (decoupled).  Dashed arrow = direct service call (tight coupling, only used\nwhere domain semantics demand it: starting a run requires reading the active version).\n\nKey rule: runs does NOT import alerts. The bus is the only path between them.", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Solid arrows = event-bus communication (decoupled).  Dashed arrow = direct service call (tight coupling, only used\nwhere domain semantics demand it: starting a run requires reading the active version).\n\nKey rule: runs does NOT import alerts. The bus is the only path between them.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "baseline": 12 }
